<title>LITHUANIA: EBRD SAYS INTERESTED IN TELECOM.</title>
<headline>EBRD SAYS INTERESTED IN TELECOM.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's European Affairs Ministry said on Friday that the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) had expressed its wish to participate in the privatisation of the country's telecoms.</p>
<p>The ministry said in a statement that the EBRD had submitted a proposal to participate in the privatisation of the huge state-run phone company during a meeting with European Affairs Minister Laima Andrikiene.</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
